  "customHelp": "DECK: 50 cards, max 3 copies of any card (same card_id counts across all art variants). SETUP: Draw 5 cards. Mulligan if no Character in hand. TURN: Draw 1 → Play cards (Characters to Field, Events to Stack, Case to Case zone, Partner to Partner zone) → Contact (attack with your Characters) → End. EVIDENCE: Gain evidence tokens equal to the LP of each opponent Character you KO via Contact. FILE AREA (Discard): When your discard reaches 7+ cards, use your Partner's [Assist] to enter Deduction Phase. WIN: During Deduction Phase, if your evidence >= Case Level, use Partner's [Case Solved] to win!",
